<title>UK: Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs steady - Andersen.</title>
<headline>Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs steady - Andersen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of oil and gas rigs active in offshore Northwest Europe held steady at 61 in the week ended November 6, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>There were 28 rigs active in U.K. waters and 19 in Norway, both unchanged on the week.</p>
<p>Activity in other sectors was also steady at 10 rigs in the Netherlands, three rigs in Denmark and one in Ireland.</p>
<p>Onshore activity stayed the same at three rigs in Britain and one in the Faroe Islands.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 542 6280.</p>
</text>
